# Claude project-specific files.
# Ignore the machine-local bits (settings.local.json, worktrees, caches)
# but version the skills and commands: `.claude/skills/` is the only
# location Claude Code actually loads project skills from, so leaving it
# untracked meant the repo's own runbooks lived on one machine.
# The parent must be excluded with `/*` rather than `/` — git will not
# descend into a fully-ignored directory, so the negations below would
# never be evaluated.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/

.superpowers/
.env.superpowers/
.mcp.json
# CLAUDE.md (root + nested) is intentionally tracked — it's project
# guidance that any contributor or AI assistant in this repo needs to
# see, and historically lived as ignored local-only notes. Use a
# CLAUDE.local.md sibling for genuinely personal scratch notes if you
# need one.
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md

# Local-only subagent-stream sanity-check fixture — see
# src/lib/__tests__/subagentStreams.test.ts (the test skipIf()s when absent).
session_json/
